"%1$@ verification failed." = "%1$@ 校验失败。";
" Automatic rollback could not finish. Restore from the backups of both browsers." = " 自动回滚未能全部完成，请从双边备份恢复。";
" This write was rolled back. Both backups were retained." = " 已撤回本次写入，双边备份保留。";
"Backup verification failed. Sync was stopped." = "备份校验失败，已停止同步。";
"This backup version is unsupported." = "不支持此备份版本。";
"Microsoft Edge Stable was not found. Install and open Edge. Beta, Dev, and Canary are not supported." = "没有找到 Microsoft Edge 正式版。请先安装并打开 Edge（Beta / Dev / Canary 暂不支持）。";
"Edge is not running. Sync was skipped and Safari tabs were preserved." = "Edge 未运行，已跳过同步并保留 Safari 标签。";
"Safari is not running. Open Safari to allow a complete session backup." = "Safari 未运行，已跳过同步。请先打开 Safari，以便完整备份当前会话。";
"Edge returned %1$@ windows and no tabs. Mirror was stopped and Safari was preserved. Confirm the webpages are in the current Edge windows." = "Edge 返回 %1$@ 个窗口、0 个标签，已停止镜像并保留 Safari。请确认网页位于当前打开的 Edge 窗口中。";
"Edge returned %1$@ windows and %2$@ tabs, but none are supported Safari addresses. New and blank tabs are supported. Mirror was stopped and Safari was preserved." = "读到 Edge %1$@ 个窗口、%2$@ 个标签，但均为无法在 Safari 打开的内部页面或其他不支持的地址。新建页和空白页可同步；本次已停止镜像并保留 Safari。";
"Read %1$@ Edge tabs. No additions needed. Skipped %2$@ unsupported addresses." = "读到 Edge %1$@ 个标签，无需新增。跳过 %2$@ 个不支持的地址。";
"Automatic mirror check backup (identical tabs)" = "镜像检查自动备份（标签一致）";
"Safari and Edge tabs match. A backup was saved; no replacement was needed." = "Safari 与 Edge 标签一致，已备份，无需替换。";
"Automatic backup before mirror" = "镜像前自动备份";
"Automatic backup before incremental sync" = "增量同步前自动备份";
"Edge tabs changed during preparation. This sync was stopped; try again." = "Edge 标签在准备期间发生变化，已停止本次同步，请重试。";
"%1$@ complete: %2$@ tabs. Safari was backed up. %3$@ new or blank tabs mapped to Safari blank pages; %4$@ unsupported addresses were skipped." = "%1$@完成：%2$@ 个标签；已自动备份 Safari。%3$@ 个新建/空白页映射为 Safari 空白页，跳过 %4$@ 个不支持的地址。";
"About Safari Bookmark Sync" = "关于 Safari 收藏夹同步";
